    "explanation": "Mal'Ganis is good on Maps that have narrow passages and corridors, allowing him to get amazing area of effect value from most of his Abilities, and/or where the Objective does not spawn too often because he really needs his Heroic Ability in order to be a complete Hero, but he is bad on Maps that do not have good places where to flank from."
